# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PART 30 — P6, SIDECAR MANIFEST FIDELITY: DEGRADING A SIDECAR MAY ONLY WIDEN                 [TIER 1]
#
# The self-differential family's structural gap, closed. P2 and P3 degrade the chained DEP REPORT; nothing
